{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32137","headline":"湖阴词 · 温庭筠","name":"湖阴词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祖龙黄须珊瑚鞭，铁骢金面青连钱。\n虎髯拔劒欲成梦，日压贼营如血鲜。\n海旗风急惊眠起，甲重光摇照湖水。\n苍黄追骑尘外归，森索妖星阵前死。\n五陵愁碧春萋萋，霸川玉马空中嘶。\n羽书如电入青璅，雪腕如槌催画鞞。\n白虬天子金煌鋩，高临帝座回龙章。\n吴波不动楚山晚，花压阑干春昼长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}